    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4v9wyvk",
      "content": "<img></img>Arunachal Pradesh is called the 'Land of the Rising Sun' and also the 'Paradise of Botanists and Anthropologists'. The state is home to the largest number of tribes in India — over 26 major tribes and more than 100 sub-tribes — each with its own language, customs, festivals, dress, and social structure."
    },
